With a suboptimal AC, you might never reach that stage of the game.

> Also, given that ALL your hard-earned protection can disappear because
> of one stupid mistake, I really don't find it to be all that
> important. I view it as a bonus, something to do with all that gold
> that I inevitably accumulate, not as a major goal to strive for early
